{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n 21歳の誕生日を\n こんなに大勢の人に\n 祝ってもらってるなんて\n 想像もしてなかったです。\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG352G15HZVCDS7G585N6H3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG353ZYP2CXMWMSA4MMZ3NT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 中学3年生と\n こんなに仲良くなるなんて\n 思ってなかったです。\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG355D2D5J036KQPZ6X6JEW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG356H2PANQXNYPJCYK4X0Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 私のときめき彼氏きょうこ♡\n \n 私のために\n 朝まで寝れなくなっちゃう人にも\n 出会えなかったと思います。\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG357WBFP9MK3WHT0C1P874","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n こんなに大きなお花だって\n ぜったいもらうことはありませんでした。\n \n \n こんなに可愛いトレーナーも\n 作ってもらえるなんて。感激です。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG35958J79J2WAFVTGAG9NY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 生誕祭という\n 素敵なお祭りを\n 開いてもらうことも\n ありえなかったです。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG35AFJM9ZBDPTQJSMKEKH8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 私とツーショットが撮れる\n パネルまで作ってもらって。\n \n \n \n \n こんなに盛大に\n 誕生日を祝ってもらえるなんて\n \n \n \n 去年の私は考えもつきませんでした。\n \n \n \n \n すごく嬉しかったです。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG35BKTGZGT12EJG5XYBK6F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n ありがとうでいっぱいです。\n \n \n \n ありがとうございます。"}],"source":"archive"}